// Rule: [T1543.003] Armored Likho - Still Toolkit Service Installation
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1543.003
// Classification: Hunting query
// Status: Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Sentinel / Log Analytics
// Required telemetry: SecurityEvent
// Purpose: Campaign hunt for source-observed Windows services created by T elegram-theft and audio surveillance implants.
// Logic: Evaluate SecurityEvent for still toolkit service installation using the existing source-derived conditions while preserving projected investigation context.
// A match proves: The host recorded installation of a source-observed Still T oolkit service name and requires immediate service, file and installer review.
// A match does not prove: Malicious ImagePath, service start, implant execution, T elegram access, microphone use, C2 traffic, successful persistence or Armored Likho attribution.
// Expected false positives: authorized administration, approved software, testing, or benign artifact collisions.
// Coverage limits: local schema, field population, retention, collection scope, and attacker variation require validation.
// Evidence claims: C001, C002, C003
//
// Armored Likho / Still Toolkit Windows service installation
// Classification: Hunting query - Untested implementation sketch
// Confidence: Medium
// Primary platform: Microsoft Sentinel / Log Analytics
// Required connector: Windows Security Events via AMA with Event ID 4697
// Source evidence: Kaspersky observed Still Sync creating the TReload service
// and Still Audio creating the auxhost service when --console is absent.
// The service names are mutable campaign artifacts; a match requires triage.

SecurityEvent
| where EventID == 4697
| where ServiceName in~ ("TReload", "auxhost")
| project
    TimeGenerated,
    Computer,
    EventID,
    EventRecordId,
    ServiceName,
    ServiceFileName,
    ServiceType,
    ServiceStartType,
    ServiceAccount,
    SubjectUserSid,
    SubjectUserName,
    SubjectDomainName,
    SubjectLogonId,
    Activity,
    EventSourceName,
    _ResourceId
| order by TimeGenerated desc
